# Service level summary

For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened [[cite:obs-5c3dd4a954b57dc1ef253c58610582148ac134a5 "For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened."]].

Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation [[cite:obs-a72b91e703517e95e73d486a8cf11a2e5c83e99c "Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation."]].
